description = "A tote's directory need not have the name of its package: the package is named by its Tauto.eure, and the tote checks wherever it is."

@ cases.library-tote-in-a-directory-of-another-name-checks
files_tote = "lib"
tote_errors = []
files."lib/Tauto.eure" = 'package { name = "other" }'
files."lib/src/a.taut" = ```tauto
import std::base
fn two(): Nat { Succ(Succ(Zero)) }
```
